# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Salvazion App — environment template (single source of truth)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Copy to .env.local and fill real values:
#   cp .env.example .env.local
#
# .env.local is gitignored. Never commit secrets.
# Production: set the same keys in Vercel → Environment Variables.
#
# Domains:
#   Primary: https://salvazion.org
#   Legacy aliases (redirect): app.salvazion.org, www.salvazion.org
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ─── App ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://salvazion.org
# CAPACITOR_SERVER_URL=https://salvazion.org

# ─── Supabase ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Project Settings → API
# Project ref (docs): kppylfrsclkdmtpobpxd
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://kppylfrsclkdmtpobpxd.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
# service_role secret — server only (Stripe webhook → public.subscriptions)
# Never use NEXT_PUBLIC_ for this key.
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
# Optional: SQL scripts from CLI (npm run db:phalanx)
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres.PROJECT:PASSWORD@aws-0-REGION.pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres
# SUPABASE_DB_PASSWORD=

# ─── Auth (X / Google) ────────────────────────────────────────
# X/Google secrets van SOLO en Supabase Auth → Providers (no aquí).
# Login X = OAuth 2.0 only (provider "x"). No Twitter OAuth 1.0a.
# Guía: docs/auth-x.md

# ─── Grok / xAI (server only) ─────────────────────────────────
# https://console.x.ai
# XAI_API_KEY=
# XAI_MODEL=grok-4.5
# XAI_BASE_URL=https://api.x.ai/v1
# XAI_TTS_VOICE=ara

# ─── Solana / $SALVAZION ──────────────────────────────────────
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SOLANA_RPC_URL=https://mainnet.helius-rpc.com/?api-key=YOUR_KEY
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SOLANA_NETWORK=mainnet-beta
# Server-only RPC for the holder bonus balance check (falls back to NEXT_PUBLIC_SOLANA_RPC_URL, then public mainnet)
# SOLANA_RPC_URL=https://mainnet.helius-rpc.com/?api-key=YOUR_KEY
# HMAC secret for holder-verify challenges (falls back to SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY)
# HOLDER_VERIFY_SECRET=long-random-string
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SALVAZION_MINT=2XALhxGKCr2zCADkMANBq3b6rV7Zv5QF6RVZokgEAfUM

# ─── Jupiter Mobile (WalletConnect / Reown) ───────────────────
# https://dashboard.reown.com/
# NEXT_PUBLIC_REOWN_PROJECT_ID=

# ─── Stripe Premium (Salvazion, Inc.) ─────────────────────────
# https://dashboard.stripe.com/apikeys
# Webhook: https://salvazion.org/api/billing/webhook
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_live_... or rk_live_...
# STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_...
# Checkout resolves prices by Stripe lookup_key (salvazion_premium_monthly_49 /
# salvazion_premium_annual_39). Do not point these at the legacy $20 price
# price_1Ty0isHOw5ZkjRlZ6t5TRGje (still product default_price — Checkout ignores it).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PRODUCT_ID=prod_UxwcMVMNlKeczI
# NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PRICE_MONTHLY=price_1U0WEWHOw5ZkjRlZHXRW0gAX
# NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PRICE_ANNUAL=price_1U0WEXHOw5ZkjRlZOwkxysed
# Stripe Dashboard: Support email = info@salvazion.org (see docs/email.md)

# ─── Product email (From: info@salvazion.org) ─────────────────
# Policy: all app/auth/billing-related mail uses info@salvazion.org.
# Auth emails: configure Supabase Custom SMTP (dashboard) — not these keys.
# Stripe invoices: Dashboard support email + optional custom domain.
# App transactional (logros, avisos): Resend API below.
# Full guide: docs/email.md
# EMAIL_FROM=info@salvazion.org
# EMAIL_FROM_NAME=Salvazion
# EMAIL_REPLY_TO=info@salvazion.org
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxx

# ─── Wearables OAuth (Premium) ────────────────────────────────
# Redirect URI each provider must match:
#   {NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL}/api/wearables/oauth/{provider}/callback
# Fitbit → Google Health API (legacy Fitbit Web API ends 2026-09-30):
#   docs/google-health-api-setup.md
# WEARABLES_TOKEN_SECRET=generate-a-long-random-string
# GOOGLE_HEALTH_CLIENT_ID=
# GOOGLE_HEALTH_CLIENT_SECRET=
# FITBIT_CLIENT_ID=          # optional fallback only
# FITBIT_CLIENT_SECRET=
# OURA_CLIENT_ID=
# OURA_CLIENT_SECRET=
# WHOOP_CLIENT_ID=
# WHOOP_CLIENT_SECRET=
# GARMIN_CLIENT_ID=
# GARMIN_CLIENT_SECRET=

# Bearer token for GET /api/internal/holder-metrics (aggregate counts only). Unset → 503.
# METRICS_READ_TOKEN=long-random-string
